# Minimal disordered PVDF fixture. Ordered C backbone (disorder_group 0) with
# two alternative fluorine sites (disorder_group 1 and 2, occupancy 0.5).
# Used to verify that disorder groups never cross-bond.
data_pvdf_disordered
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M   'P1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number      1
_cell_length_a                   8.58
_cell_length_b                   4.91
_cell_length_c                   2.56
_cell_angle_alpha                90.0
_cell_angle_beta                 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma                90.0
loop_
_symmetry_equiv_pos_as_xyz
'x, y, z'
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
_atom_site_occupancy
_atom_site_disorder_group
C1 C 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000 1.0 0
C2 C 0.000000 0.170700 0.500000 1.0 0
F1 F 0.158000 0.170700 0.500000 0.5 1
F2 F 0.842000 0.170700 0.500000 0.5 2
